{"kind":"artifact","text":"Candidate: the attention endpoint at internal/service on the same head. POST /v0/attention answers with the live cursor, this session's unacknowledged addressed frames with pending and omitted counts, and the matching actors. It fails soft by construction: a session the hub has never seen still receives an answer about other people's leases, because refusing the whole read when half of it is unavailable would turn an advisory adjunct into a precondition. Tests cover the unknown session, the empty request, actor visibility, caller exclusion and multi-session aggregation through the endpoint; the degraded and aggregation paths were verified by mutation.","body":{"commit":"35bcd321629d531909ee8aff33dbfa3214008cda","path":"internal/service"}}